{
  "$comment": "Cross-asset instrument catalogue. `key` is an archive asset field, or a derived id with `expr` (spread: (a−b)×scale · fly: (2×body−w1−w2)×scale · pctvs: (a/b−1)×100 · rel: a/b rebased to 100). `fmt`: yield | prob | bp | index | fx | level | pctlvl. `sub` groups rows inside a tab. `freq`: monthly (prints) or policy (decided rates), drawn as steps without per-session statistics. `note` explains a derived series in the drill-down. `label` may use {asof:<field>}. `dimensionLinks` maps each regime dimension to the instrument it reads, for navigation.",
  "groups": [
    {
      "id": "rates",
      "name": "Rates",
      "rows": [
        {
          "label": "US 2Y",
          "key": "usy2",
          "fmt": "yield",
